  "description": "Canonical naming conventions for Flow elements (Get_/Update_/Decision_/Loop_/Assignment_), resource variables (var/coll/map/formula/choice/constant/stage/screen), Decision branch outcomes, Stage/Step labels in Orchestrations, Subflow input/output contracts, and fault-path target names. NOT for object or field API naming (use admin/object-creation-and-design) or flow portfolio retirement \u2014 use flow/flow-governance.",
  "file_location": "skills/flow/flow-element-naming-conventions",
  "id": "flow/flow-element-naming-conventions",
  "inputs": [
    "Flow design or Flow XML to be named/audited",
    "List of existing Flow elements + their current API names",
    "Subflow input/output signatures (if reviewing subflow contracts)"
  ],
  "name": "flow-element-naming-conventions",
